<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`文件上传这一节，收和发两侧。

先说接收。看右边，UploadRequest 里两个字段，name 是字符串，file 是「可空的 MultipartFile」。Controller 上声明 consumes 是 multipart/form-data，函数参数用 RequestBody 接收整个 multipart 对象，然后打印文件大小和 name，返回 ok。

这里关键是 file 的类型。MultipartFile 是 f_http 的类型，它同时实现了 Multipart、InputStream、Resource、DataFields 和 Data——也就是说它既是数据，能进 f_data 体系；又是一个输入流，能直接读。

它的常用成员：filename、size、empty；isAttachment、isInline、isFormData 这三个来自 ContentDisposition；read、bytes、copyTo、reader 四个读取方式。

一个必须强调的点：它是 Resource，用完要 close。close 会连临时文件一起删掉，不会在磁盘上留垃圾。这也是第十八章的一个高频坑。

再说发送。构造一个 MultipartFormData，然后 newPart 链式构造：name 加 value 是普通字段，name 加 file 是文件字段，传入文件名、内容流和大小。最后 encode 写到输出流，或者拿 input 拿到一个 MultipartFileInputStream 自己读。boundary 是自动生成的。

配置两项：http_halfBufferSize 是 multipart 缓冲区的一半大小，默认两千零四十八字节；http_uploadDir 是上传文件的临时保存路径。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 11 章 · HTTP 数据格式 f_http · 11.6</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>文件上传：multipart/form-data</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>multipart/form-data</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#38BDF8', marginBottom: 8 }}>接收 · fdemo/user/src/controller/UploadController.cj</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"@DataAssist[props fields]"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"public class UploadRequest {"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private var name: String = ''"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    private var file: ?MultipartFile = None"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, marginTop: 8, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"@Controller"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'@PostMapping[path: \'/upload\', produces: \'text/plain\', consumes: \'multipart/form-data\']'}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@IgnoreSecurity</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"public func upload(@RequestBody multipart: UploadRequest): String {"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    println('${multipart.file?.size} ${multipart.name}')"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'    \'ok\''}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.65, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 8 }}>发送</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>let form = MultipartFormData()</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"form.newPart().name('name').value('abc')"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"form.newPart().file(fileName: 'a.txt', content: inputStream, size: 1234)"}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>form.encode(output)</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>let in = form.input()</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 10 }}>boundary 自动生成：FountainBoundary 加 32 位随机字母数字（又见 f_random）。</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #F59E0B', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F59E0B' }}>它是 Resource，用完必须 close()</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>常用成员：filename / size / empty；isAttachment / isInline / isFormData；read / bytes / copyTo / reader。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>close() 会连临时文件一起删掉，不会在磁盘上留垃圾。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 'auto', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>export http_halfBufferSize=2048　·　export http_uploadDir=/tmp/fountain/upload</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#22D3EE', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>curl -XPOST http://localhost:8080/upload -F 'name=abc' -F 'file=@./banner.txt'</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>73 / 116</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
